              remotely creating branches will be denied\n#   in the repository. 
              By default this is allowed.\n#\n\n# --- Command
              line\nrefname=\"$1\"\noldrev=\"$2\"\nnewrev=\"$3\"\n\n# --- Safety
              check\nif [ -z \"$GIT_DIR\" ]; then\n\techo \"Don't run this
